        (362, 2501, 'Mises en garde', 'For health care practitioner dispensing only. Consult a health care practitioner for prolonged use; if symptoms persist or worsen, or if new symptoms develop; and prior to use if you have serious or major conditions or if taking prescription medications.'),
        (363, 2747, 'Contre-indications', 'Do not use if you are pregnant or breastfeeding. Do not use if you are taking, or have taken in the past two weeks monoamine oxidase (MAO) inhibitors.'),
        (364, 2747, 'Mises en garde', 'Consult a health care practitioner if symptoms persist or worsen. Consult a health care practitioner prior to use if you are taking medication and/or natural health products for allergy symptoms, asthma, cough or cold, or weight control. Consult a healthcare practitioner prior to use if you are taking other products which contain caffeine,  ephedrine, phenylpropanolamine or pseudoephedrine. Consult a health care practitioner prior to use if you have glaucoma, seizure disorders, cardiovascular disease, diabetes, difficulty in urination due to prostate enlargement, pre-existing psychiatric conditions or thyroid problems. Keep out of reach of children.'),
        (365, 2747, 'Réactions indésirables', 'Insomnia and rapid heartbeat have been known to occur; in which case, discontinue use. Restlessness, irritability, dizziness, tremor, severe headache, insomnia, loss of appetite, nausea, rapid heartbeat, shortness of breath and/or disturbance of urination have been known to occur; in which case, discontinue use.'),
