        (613, 2578, 'Mises en garde', 'If accidental ingestion occurs, seek urgent medical attention or contact a Poison Control Centre.  Keep out of reach of children.  If symptoms persist or worsen, consult a health care practitioner.  If you have epilepsy or asthma, consult a health care practitioner prior to use.  Avoid exposure of applied area(s) to the sun.'),
